WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.292
Look at this wild

00:00:01.292 --> 00:00:04.421
map of every public sauna in Finland.

00:00:04.421 --> 00:00:05.505
This was made by a Reddit user,

00:00:05.505 --> 00:00:07.382
and I have no way of fact checking it,

00:00:07.382 --> 00:00:08.591
but one thing's for certain

00:00:08.591 --> 00:00:10.802
is that Finns love their saunas.

00:00:10.802 --> 00:00:11.344
Every government

00:00:11.344 --> 00:00:12.846
building is required to have one.

00:00:12.846 --> 00:00:14.264
And not just to relax–

00:00:14.264 --> 00:00:16.266
to conduct diplomacy as well.

00:00:16.266 --> 00:00:17.267
The Finnish president

00:00:17.267 --> 00:00:18.768
and the head of the Soviet Union

00:00:18.768 --> 00:00:19.853
saunaed together

00:00:19.853 --> 00:00:22.230
and they came to some good agreements

00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:23.314
that allowed Finland

00:00:23.314 --> 00:00:24.816
to stay neutral in the Cold War.

00:00:24.816 --> 00:00:26.901
Two sweaty, naked world leaders

00:00:26.901 --> 00:00:28.028
negotiating Finland's

00:00:28.028 --> 00:00:30.739
neutrality during the Cold War in a sauna. 

00:00:30.739 --> 00:00:31.573
I freaking love it.

00:00:31.573 --> 00:00:34.034
Finland just joined NATO and guess what?

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:35.785
NATO is installing a sauna.

00:00:35.785 --> 00:00:37.245
And here in Washington DC,

00:00:37.245 --> 00:00:38.246
where I live,

00:00:38.246 --> 00:00:41.124
the Finnish embassy has a sauna society

00:00:41.124 --> 00:00:41.916
where they invite people

00:00:41.916 --> 00:00:43.209
to come sauna with them

00:00:43.209 --> 00:00:45.295
and talk about global affairs.

00:00:45.295 --> 00:00:46.296
Am I making this video

00:00:46.296 --> 00:00:47.881
because I secretly want to be invited

00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:49.174
to the Finnish Sauna Society

00:00:49.174 --> 00:00:49.883
here in Washington, D.C.?

00:00:49.883 --> 00:00:50.633
Yes.

00:00:50.633 --> 00:00:51.217
So, Finland,

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:52.510
if you are hearing this,

00:00:52.510 --> 00:00:54.804
I accept your invite, if you'll have me.

00:00:54.804 --> 00:00:55.597
If you want to better understand

00:00:55.597 --> 00:00:57.432
global politics, follow along for more.

